  "implementation": [
    "Renderer native chooser returns selected bytes; captures document/version/target before read and rejects late or stale results.",
    "Main native raster-inspect decodes one frame within 20 MiB, 16 Mi pixels and 8192-axis bounds; rejects non-default EXIF orientation. Internal hash/dimensions receipt is not accepted from renderer.",
    "Worker verifies PNG chunks/CRC/order/deflate/scanlines or JPEG full framing; mutates only after validation. Original media bytes are embedded without reencoding.",
    "Replacement redirects only target picture relation, preserving old media/other users/crop/transform/effects. Undo restores original package parts."
  ],
